                    <h2 class="hero-title-light hero-anim">Fashion</h2>
                    <h2 class="hero-title-bold hero-anim">Glasses</h2>
                    <p class="hero-sub hero-anim">Best eyeglasses for women to channel your inner Clark Kent</p>
                    <a href="#" class="hero-btn hero-anim">Shop the collection</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item">
                <img class="hero-img" src="https://i.ibb.co.com/QvN0kN3Y/hero-images-2.jpg" alt="The hotlist of summer" />
                <div class="hero-caption">
                    <p class="hero-label hero-anim">Fashion Trends</p>
                    <h2 class="hero-title-light hero-anim">The Hotlist of</h2>
                    <h2 class="hero-title-bold hero-anim">Summer</h2>
                    <p class="hero-sub hero-anim">The 12 Biggest Spring/Summer 2021 Trends</p>
                    <a href="#" class="hero-btn hero-anim">Shop the collection</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-item">
                <img class="hero-img" src="https://i.ibb.co.com/FbkwZKSs/hero-images-3.jpg" alt="Find your perfect style" />
                <div class="hero-caption">
                    <p class="hero-label hero-anim">New Collection</p>
                    <h2 class="hero-title-light hero-anim">Find Your</h2>
                    <h2 class="hero-title-bold hero-anim">Perfect</h2>
                    <p class="hero-sub hero-anim">Uncompromising in style, quality and performance</p>
                    <a href="#" class="hero-btn hero-anim">Shop the collection</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

